"读到这里，您应已跑通事件型因子研究闭环：形态信号 → ``K=5`` 窗口化 → ``where`` → ``portfolio`` + "
"benchmark → CAGR → K 线高亮解释。"
msgstr ""
"After reading this, you should have run through the closed loop of event-"
"type factor research: morphological signal → ``K=5`` 窗口化 → ``where`` → "
"``portfolio`` + benchmark → CAGR → K-line highlight explanation."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.8-historypanel-advanced-event-kline-pattern.md:532
msgid ""
"**注**：该链路为研究向粗聚合，不含交易成本、交割、下单约束等；若要做可回测策略，须把事件窗口规则写进 ``Strategy.realize()`` "
"并交给 ``Operator``。"
msgstr ""
"**Note**: This link is a rough aggregation for research and does not include"
" transaction costs, delivery, order constraints, etc.; if you want to make a"
" backtestable strategy, you must write the event window rules into "
"``Strategy.realize()`` 并交给 ``Operator``."

